\caption{Computational Resources Plots comparing Aarens and Transformers (using KV-caching) when processing a sequence of tokens. (Left) Memory Usage Comparison. (Right) Cumulative Time Comparison. 
}
\label{fig:analyses}
\end{figure}




\textbf{Memory Complexity:} In Figure \ref{fig:analyses} (left), we compare the memory usage of Aarens and Transformers (using KV-caching) at inference time. We see that the memory usage of Transformers grow linearly with the KV-caching technique. In contrast, Aarens only use constant memory regardless of the number of tokens, making it significantly more efficient.

